> **PRUBETH** is an elite, production-grade autonomous software engineering developer CLI engineered to plan, code, verify, and self-heal complex multi-file software projects. Built from the ground up for high reliability, zero-font-blur Windows rendering, and full multi-model support: cloud APIs (Google Gemini, OpenRouter, Claude, OpenAI) and **100% private offline local models** (Ollama, LM Studio).

---

## 🌟 Key Features

- 🧠 **Automatic Cognitive Shifter (Highest to Lowest)**: Automatically routes starting from flagship frontier pro reasoning models (`gemini-3.1-pro-preview`, `openrouter/free` 550B & 120B) down through high-performance balanced models (`gemini-3.8-flash`, `nemotron-3.5-lightning`) to ultra-fast lite models (`gemini-3.1-flash-lite`, `gemma-31b`).
- 🛡️ **Direct Local Pivot on API Key Issues**: If cloud API keys are missing, expired, or encounter `HTTP 401: Unauthorized` / `HTTP 403: Forbidden`, PRUBETH **directly and automatically switches execution to your local model** in $< 120\text{ms}$ with zero workflow stoppage!
- ⚡ **Latency Timeout Guard**: If remote cloud inference takes too long ($> 12\text{s}$ or hangs), PRUBETH automatically fast-probes your PC and **instantly auto-switches to any local downloaded model** in Ollama or LM Studio.
- 📦 **One-Click Local Model Downloader**: Interactive onboarding wizard (`prubeth setup`) that detects local AI engines and provides one-click commands to download lightweight coding models (`qwen2.5-coder:1.5b`, `qwen2.5-coder:7b`, `llama3.2:3b`).
- 🔄 **Autonomous Loop & Speculative Plan B**: Self-healing recovery loop that drafts Plan B alongside Plan A, auto-pivoting when unit tests or AST invariants fail.
- 🌳 **Pure-Python Shadow Worktrees**: Subagents work in isolated sandbox worktrees (`.prubeth/worktrees/`) before merging cleanly to the root workspace.
- 🔒 **Zero External Git Dependency**: Deterministic checkpoints and instant rollbacks powered by pure-Python SHA-256 snapshots. No `git.exe` binary required.
- 🎨 **PRINCE3 Zero Font Blur Rendering**: Native hardware `CP 65001` UTF-8 code page and modern ANSI rendering.
- 🚀 **Ultra-Low Memory Footprint**: Pure-Python orchestration runtime strictly bounded at **$< 33\text{ MB}$ CPU RAM**, leaving 100% of PC GPU VRAM free for local model execution.
- 🩺 **Autonomous System Therapy & Auto-Remediation (`prubeth therapy`)**: Proactively monitors and auto-heals configuration drift, repairs schema types, performs SQLite WAL maintenance (`wal_checkpoint(TRUNCATE)`), auto-corrects terminal encoding, trims memory pools, and optimizes cognitive latency failover.
- ⚙️ **Interactive Deep Configuration Wizard (`prubeth configure --deep`)**: Fine-grained multi-step setup to calibrate operational profiles, latency budgets, watchdog timers, and sandbox rules.
- 🔄 **Factory Default Reset Engine**: Single command (`prubeth reset`) restores clean factory defaults and returns to initial setup mode anytime.

