## 🚀 Installation & Quickstart

### 1. Install Globally on Your PC
Ensure Python 3.10+ is installed, then run in PowerShell / Bash:

```powershell
# Clone or navigate to the repository directory
cd prubeth-autonomous-cli

# Install in editable / development mode globally
pip install -e .
```

Verify global availability:
```powershell
prubeth --help
```

---

### 2. Run Interactive Onboarding & Setup
Launch the first-time onboarding wizard:
```powershell
prubeth setup
```

This wizard will:
1. Inspect your system for local AI engines (Ollama, LM Studio).
2. Display connection status and configured API keys.
3. Provide one-click commands to download lightweight coding models from the internet.

---

### 3. Local AI Model Download (Ollama / LM Studio)

If you prefer 100% free, private, offline execution without cloud API keys, download any of these models via Ollama:

```powershell
# Lightweight & Ultra-Fast (~1.2 GB - Runs on Any PC/Laptop):
ollama run qwen2.5-coder:1.5b

# Recommended High-Capability Coding Model (~4.7 GB):
ollama run qwen2.5-coder:7b

# Meta Llama 3.2 Compact Model (~2.0 GB):
ollama run llama3.2:3b
```

Once downloaded, PRUBETH auto-detects it on port `11434` in **$< 120\text{ms}$** with zero manual configuration.

---

### 4. Configure Cloud API Keys (Optional)

```powershell
# Configure Google Gemini API Key:
prubeth config set api_keys.google "<YOUR_GEMINI_KEY>"

# Configure OpenRouter Key (Access to 20+ Free Models):
prubeth config set api_keys.openrouter "<YOUR_OPENROUTER_KEY>"
```

---

### 5. Run Autonomous Engineering Tasks

```powershell
# Execute autonomous coding goal with auto-approved actions:
prubeth run "Create a FastAPI authentication service with pytest suite"

# Inspect the master HUD and Performance Builder metrics:
prubeth --status

# View the full Highest-to-Lowest model hierarchy & local engine status:
prubeth models

# Test model connectivity live:
prubeth models test

# Run Pre-Flight Qualification Suite (Google & Anthropic Doctor standard):
prubeth doctor

# Run System Therapy & Automated Auto-Remediation (7 Pillars of Self-Healing):
prubeth therapy

# Launch Interactive Deep Configuration Wizard:
prubeth configure --deep

# Inspect complete CLI version, hardware architecture, and Zero-Telemetry guarantee:
prubeth --version

# Generate native shell tab completion (PowerShell / Bash / Zsh):
prubeth completion powershell >> $PROFILE

# Factory Default Reset (Restores pristine first-onboarding state anytime):
prubeth reset
```

---

## 🛡️ Pre-Flight Qualification & Doctor

Modeled after `gcloud info`, `gh doctor`, and Flutter Doctor, PRUBETH includes an automated 8-pillar preflight diagnostic engine:

```powershell
prubeth doctor
```

```
========================================================================================
Production Readiness Verification Checklist (8 Pillars)
========================================================================================
  [PASS] 1. Python Runtime & Architecture      - Python 3.12 (64-bit)
  [PASS] 2. Terminal Subsystem (PRINCE3)       - CP 65001 Hardware ANSI TrueColor
  [PASS] 3. Hardware Memory Footprint          - 32.4 MB CPU RAM (0 MB GPU VRAM)
  [INFO] 4. Cloud AI Provider Gateways         - Google Gemini & OpenRouter credentials
  [PASS] 5. Local Offline Engine (Air-Gapped)  - Ollama :11434 daemon detected
  [PASS] 6. DevSecOps Sandbox & Path Jail      - Workspace path traversal strictly blocked
  [PASS] 7. Persistence & Snapshot Tree        - SQLite WAL & zero-external-git snapshots
  [PASS] 8. Cognitive Shifter & Latency Guard  - 12s timeout -> Local Auto-Pivot
========================================================================================
System Qualification: ACCEPTED (100% Production Ready)
========================================================================================
```

