## 📦 Cryptographic Release Packages & Verification

Official release distributions are built in `dist/` and cryptographically signed with SHA-256 hashes:

| Release Artifact | Size | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `dist/prubeth-1.0.0-py3-none-any.whl` | ~99.8 KB | Universal Python Wheel |
| `dist/prubeth-1.0.0.tar.gz` | ~90.1 KB | Official Source Distribution |
| `dist/SHA256SUMS.txt` | 158 B | Cryptographic SHA-256 Verification Hashes |

Verify integrity on Windows:
```powershell
Get-FileHash -Algorithm SHA256 dist/*
```

